Debian/Devuan packaging for this librsvg tree
=============================================

Source package: **librsvg-c** (does not collide with GNOME/Rust librsvg2).
Binaries replace librsvg2-2, librsvg2-common, librsvg2-dev, and
librsvg2-bin. SONAME stays **librsvg-2.so.2**.

css/ is the only CSS engine. `libcroco/` is an unbuilt archive and is
not packaged.

Layout
------

Files live in this directory (`dist/debian/`), not `dist/debian/debian/`.

Build (does not install onto the live host)
-------------------------------------------

From the source tree root:

    make deb
    # or: ./dist/debian/build-deb.sh

Outputs land **only** in `../debpkg/`.
The script does not leave
`.deb` / `.changes` / `.buildinfo` in the source tree or its parent,
and it does not install onto the host.

Manual alternative:

    ln -sfn dist/debian debian
    dpkg-buildpackage -b -k2F4939F1142E522362100BD39CA0BE9629EAB796
    mv ../librsvg-c*.deb ../librsvg-c*.changes ../librsvg-c*.buildinfo \
      ../debpkg/

`-b` builds binary packages only. debian/rules installs via DESTDIR
(`debian/tmp`, then package dirs). Do not `dpkg -i` or `make install`
onto the build host from this tree unless you intend to displace
librsvg2 on that machine.

configure flags: `--prefix=/usr --disable-introspection --disable-vala`.
Image decoders (png, jpeg,
gif, webp, avif) stay auto. `--libdir` is set to the multiarch path.

debian/rules uses `make clean`.

Packages
--------

  librsvg-c2        shared library (css/ engine; no libcroco)
  librsvg-c-common  gdk-pixbuf SVG loader; postinst/postrm for
                    loaders.cache
  librsvg-c-dev     headers and librsvg-2.0.pc
  librsvg-c-bin     rsvg-convert

Signing fingerprint: 2F4939F1142E522362100BD39CA0BE9629EAB796
